WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
Welcome to the Man of Recaps.

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.600
This is Ahsoka, season one.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:04.933
Ahsoka Tano was introduced

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:08.500
in The Clone Wars animated series,
she was Anakin Skywalker's apprentice.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.000
She came to live action
in The Mandalorian season two,

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:14.166
where she and Mando teamed up
to take down the evil Morgan Elsbeth.

00:00:14.166 --> 00:00:15.600
Now in Ahsoka’s own series,

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.133
she tracks down the plot thing
evil lady was looking for.

00:00:18.133 --> 00:00:22.600
She fears it's a map to the lost
Imperial leader, Grand Admiral Thrawn.

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:24.600
He's a military genius
that was a main villain

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:27.266
in Star Wars Rebels,
and of course, the old novels before that.

00:00:27.266 --> 00:00:29.433
You can watch my recap
to get the full Rebels story,

00:00:29.433 --> 00:00:33.300
but at the end Thrawn was defeated
by our hero, the Young Jedi Ezra Bridger.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:37.233
He got help from the Space Whales,
the Purrgil who grabbed Thrawn’s ship

00:00:37.233 --> 00:00:38.866
and warped them both out of there!

00:00:38.866 --> 00:00:41.733
And Thrawn is a serious threat,
his return would unite

00:00:41.733 --> 00:00:44.766
all the ex-imperial forces
and kick off another war.

00:00:44.766 --> 00:00:49.366
So now on the Rebels main planet, Lothal,
we realize this show is Rebels 

00:00:49.366 --> 00:00:51.300
Ahsoka
gets the gang back together, recruits

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:54.400
ace pilot Hera Syndulla,
now a General in the New Republic,

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:58.533
and still hanging out with the team's
droid Chopper, the chaotic mayhem machine.

00:00:58.533 --> 00:01:02.866
But the main focus in the show is our
rebellious Mandalorian artist Sabine Wren.

00:01:02.866 --> 00:01:05.166
Apparently
Ahsoka tried to take her as an apprentice,

00:01:05.166 --> 00:01:06.800
but these two ended up butting heads.

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:10.333
But now Ahsoka's got the plot thing that
can help her find her lost friend, Ezra.

00:01:10.333 --> 00:01:14.433
But Morgan Elsbeth has just broken out
of prison with help from a new Dark Jedi,

00:01:14.433 --> 00:01:15.700
Baylan Skol.

00:01:15.700 --> 00:01:18.900
He has an apprentice, Evil Bangs
Girl, and sends her after Sabine

00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:20.033
for an apprentice fight.

00:01:20.033 --> 00:01:22.566
Sabine's out of practice
and she gets stabbed!

00:01:22.566 --> 00:01:25.333
But don't worry, she's fine,
who needs a spleen, anyway?

00:01:25.333 --> 00:01:28.900
So now Sabine is ready to get serious,
ritualistically cuts her hair.

00:01:28.900 --> 00:01:31.066
Alright Ahsoka, let's do this.

00:01:31.066 --> 00:01:33.133
She starts training with Ahsoka’s
droid Huyang,

00:01:33.133 --> 00:01:34.866
who was an old Jedi training droid.

00:01:34.866 --> 00:01:36.600
And Sabine is a top tier fighter,

00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:38.433
but she doesn't have much connection to the Force.

00:01:38.433 --> 00:01:40.733
Asoka explains
she's a little force sensitive,

00:01:40.733 --> 00:01:43.066
but way less than all the Jedi we know.

00:01:43.066 --> 00:01:44.966
Meanwhile,
the bad guys open up their space map,

00:01:44.966 --> 00:01:47.033
which answers how Ezra and Thrawn
have been missing this whole time,

00:01:47.033 --> 00:01:50.033
I mean, the Star Wars
galaxy isn’t that big... relatively.

00:01:50.033 --> 00:01:52.900
But turns out
they're in a different galaxy,

00:01:52.900 --> 00:01:55.466
which for space, is really far away.

00:01:55.466 --> 00:01:57.300
So Sabine
and Evil Bangs have their rematch,

00:01:57.300 --> 00:01:59.200
while Ahsoka goes for Baylan Skoll.

00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:01.033
“Hey we never met, who are you, 
what’s your deal?”

00:02:01.033 --> 00:02:03.033
Well,
turns out he seems like a cool guy

00:02:03.033 --> 00:02:04.800
who wants to do the greater good.

00:02:04.800 --> 00:02:08.733
But his greater good is clearly bad, 
so he and Ahsoka have a lightsaber fight!

00:02:08.733 --> 00:02:11.900
And Baylan Skoll is no scrub,
he's got Ahsoka on the ropes.

00:02:11.900 --> 00:02:14.300
In fact, woah! Knocks her off the cliff!

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:15.200
Sabine got the map.

00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:17.166
She's going to destroy it
so they can't find Thrawn.

00:02:17.166 --> 00:02:19.266
But that would mean
she can't find Ezra either.

00:02:19.266 --> 00:02:22.900
And so Sabine gives him the map back,
taking a pretty big gamble here.

00:02:22.900 --> 00:02:26.266
So Baylan enters the coordinates, then 
destroys the map so no one can follow them,

00:02:26.266 --> 00:02:30.166
and it's time for the bad guys
intergalactic hyperspace jump!

00:02:30.166 --> 00:02:33.633
Ahsoka meanwhile didn't die,
she wakes up in the World Between Worlds,

00:02:33.633 --> 00:02:36.300
which we know from Rebels
is like a mystical Jedi place.

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:38.866
And here she's reunited with her old master,

00:02:38.866 --> 00:02:42.233
yes Hayden Christensen back as Anakin Skywalker!

00:02:42.233 --> 00:02:43.833
He tells her
he's got a new lesson for her,

00:02:43.833 --> 00:02:47.666
and they go to a flashback to when
she was a kid fighting in the Clone Wars.

00:02:47.666 --> 00:02:50.000
She realizes
Jedi shouldn't be fighting in the war,

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:52.066
Jedis whole thing,
they're supposed to be nonviolent.

00:02:52.066 --> 00:02:55.266
At the time Anakin thought the only way
to stop violence is with more violence.

00:02:55.266 --> 00:02:57.300
And now Ahsoka realizes
maybe that was wrong

00:02:57.300 --> 00:02:59.233
and led him down
the path to the Dark Side.

00:02:59.233 --> 00:03:02.866
So now Ahsoka and Dark Side Anakin
have themselves a lightsaber rematch!

00:03:02.866 --> 00:03:05.100
But Ahsoka doesn't kill him,
throws the lightsaber away.

00:03:05.100 --> 00:03:07.266
“Yes, a Jedi should choose nonviolence.”

00:03:07.266 --> 00:03:08.933
Meanwhile Hera finally arrives,

00:03:08.933 --> 00:03:10.800
she was caught up in New Republic
bureaucracy.

00:03:10.800 --> 00:03:12.166
Most people are trying to do good,

00:03:12.166 --> 00:03:14.500
but there's still a lot of secret
imperial loyalists.

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:17.066
Luckily, C-3P0 shows up to shut this guy
down.

00:03:17.066 --> 00:03:21.000
Hera brought her son, Jacen Syndulla,
who like his father before him is Force sensitive,

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:23.533
and is able to figure out
where Ahsoka is in the water.

00:03:23.533 --> 00:03:25.466
With the map destroyed
Ahsoka can't follow,

00:03:25.466 --> 00:03:28.633
unless she asks directions
from the Purrgil themselves!

00:03:28.633 --> 00:03:32.666
Yeah these space squid whales are maybe
super cute, or maybe Eldritch Horrors.

00:03:32.666 --> 00:03:35.866
But Ahsoka’s not scared, parks
inside one’s mouth for some

00:03:35.866 --> 00:03:38.266
space whale intergalactic hitchhiking.

00:03:38.266 --> 00:03:40.533
Meanwhile,
the bad guys are in this new galaxy,

00:03:40.533 --> 00:03:43.333
but turns out it's not a new galaxy,
it's an old galaxy.

00:03:43.333 --> 00:03:45.633
It's the original home
world of the Night Sisters,

00:03:45.633 --> 00:03:48.966
the witches of Dathomir,
of whom Morgan Elsbeth is a descendant.

00:03:48.966 --> 00:03:52.600
And now pulling up
in an old Star Destroyer, oh yes it's

00:03:52.600 --> 00:03:56.766
the man himself, Grand Admiral Thrawn!!!

00:03:56.766 --> 00:03:59.166
He’s ready to come back
and restart the Empire,

00:03:59.166 --> 00:04:01.633
he just needs a day to load up something
from the witch's temple.

00:04:01.633 --> 00:04:04.100
So for now, he's
reunited with his old enemy Sabine Wren,

00:04:04.100 --> 00:04:06.166
and it's like yeah go ahead,
go look for Ezra,

00:04:06.166 --> 00:04:08.300
if she manages to find him,
you guys kill them both.

00:04:08.300 --> 00:04:10.333
So Sabine befriends
some rock turtle aliens.

00:04:10.333 --> 00:04:13.200
And who's living with them
but her friend Ezra Bridger!

00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:15.766
All grown up now, he’s grown out a beard.

00:04:15.766 --> 00:04:17.800
But the bad guys catch up to him,
and it's a big fight.

00:04:17.800 --> 00:04:19.600
Meanwhile, Ahsoka finally arrives,

00:04:19.600 --> 00:04:21.400
the space whales brought her to the right planet.

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:22.733
As Sabine has round three with her

00:04:22.733 --> 00:04:25.500
rival, Evil Bangs,
Ahsoka goes for the rematch with Baylan.

00:04:25.500 --> 00:04:29.533
But she runs away, and he doesn't pursue,
Baylan Skoll has his own mysterious goal.

00:04:29.533 --> 00:04:33.366
So Ahsoka joins the fight and turns
the tide, it looks like our good guys win!

00:04:33.366 --> 00:04:35.800
But Grand
Admiral Thrawn is a genius strategist.

00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:37.566
This whole thing was part of his plan.

00:04:37.566 --> 00:04:39.600
He distracted them with his least
favorite stormtroopers,

00:04:39.600 --> 00:04:41.700
while the rest of them finished
loading the ship.

00:04:41.700 --> 00:04:43.633
They’re ready to go back to their home galaxy,   

00:04:43.633 --> 00:04:45.500
 leaving
 the good guys stranded here.

00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:47.133
But Thrawn’s not taking any chances, sends

00:04:47.133 --> 00:04:49.066
some Tie Fighters
after them to disable their ship.

00:04:49.066 --> 00:04:50.700
But the Jedi just ride in on wolves,

00:04:50.700 --> 00:04:52.833
so Thrawn's backup plan
he sends more stormtroopers at them.

00:04:52.833 --> 00:04:56.100
But two and a half Jedi can take down
an infinite number of stormtroopers.

00:04:56.100 --> 00:04:59.966
But Thrawn had a backup backup plan,
he had the witches do a magic ritual...

00:04:59.966 --> 00:05:02.933
Oh! Brings them back
as zombie stormtroopers!

00:05:02.933 --> 00:05:05.733
This slows them down a bit, but they're
still on their way to stop that ship.

00:05:05.733 --> 00:05:08.900
But Thrawn has a triple backup plan,
the witches give Morgan Elsbeth

00:05:08.900 --> 00:05:11.633
their power, and their secret shadow
magic sword.

00:05:11.633 --> 00:05:13.466
She delays Ahsoka while Ezra and Sabine

00:05:13.466 --> 00:05:15.533
are ambushed
by super strong zombie troopers.

00:05:15.533 --> 00:05:19.466
Sabine's in trouble, it's time for her
to figure out how to use the Force...

00:05:19.466 --> 00:05:21.700
Oh! Grabs
her lightsaber, takes this thing out.

00:05:21.700 --> 00:05:23.400
But the ship’ss getting away,
the only way to catch

00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:26.933
it is with a double Force jump,
oh the jump and push!

00:05:26.933 --> 00:05:29.900
Sabine's going to do the jump and pull,
but now Ahsoka’s in trouble.

00:05:29.900 --> 00:05:32.733
So just as it looks like Ahsoka's
defeated, Sabine jumps in!

00:05:32.733 --> 00:05:36.400
Yes she stayed behind to fight with her
new mentor Ahsoka.

00:05:36.400 --> 00:05:37.833
Huyang managed to fix their ship,

00:05:37.833 --> 00:05:39.733
so they've got a chance
they could still catch Thrawn.

00:05:39.733 --> 00:05:41.800
But Thrawn still has one backup plan left...

00:05:41.800 --> 00:05:44.033
He opens a channel just to say “Hey.”

00:05:44.033 --> 00:05:46.700
Because he won, they can't catch him,

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:48.400
and he light speeds out of there

00:05:48.400 --> 00:05:52.633
back to our galaxy,
leaving Sabine and Ahsoka stranded.

00:05:52.633 --> 00:05:55.533
But they're not giving up, there's still
a lot of mysteries about this planet.

00:05:55.533 --> 00:05:58.466
Evil Bangs is still out there,
she rounds up the local barbarians

00:05:58.466 --> 00:06:00.200
like “Hey
what's up, I guess I’m your leader now?”

00:06:00.200 --> 00:06:03.666
And Baylan Skoll is dramatically
standing up on old statues.

00:06:03.666 --> 00:06:07.100
He seems to know something about 
the ancient mystical lore of this place,

00:06:07.100 --> 00:06:08.500
what is his plan?

00:06:08.500 --> 00:06:13.766
And watching over his apprentice
Ahsoka is Force Ghost Anakin Skywalker!

00:06:13.766 --> 00:06:15.833
Yeah he made it to Ghostville!

00:06:15.833 --> 00:06:19.233
Back in the main galaxy, a lone
stormtrooper boards the Republic ship.

00:06:19.233 --> 00:06:22.233
Yes indeed, it's Ezra Bridger who escaped.

00:06:22.233 --> 00:06:24.066
Good news, I'm back, bad news,

00:06:24.066 --> 00:06:28.133
Ahsoka and Sabine were left behind,
and Thrawn is back too.

00:06:28.133 --> 00:06:30.233
He's setting up at the witch's planet
Dathomir.

00:06:30.233 --> 00:06:31.433
He's got some secret plan

00:06:31.433 --> 00:06:34.566
that involves all the stuff he took from
that witch temple.

00:06:34.566 --> 00:06:37.066
What's in these boxes?
You know it's not good.

00:06:37.066 --> 00:06:40.366
Grand Admiral Thrawn is back
and ready to revive the Empire.

00:06:40.366 --> 00:06:43.633
And that’s
where Ahsoka season one comes to an end.

00:06:44.433 --> 00:06:45.600
If you like this recap,

00:06:45.600 --> 00:06:49.400
hit that subscribe button for more of the
best recaps of TV and movies.

